{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n    ps[rep] =\n    Block[\n        {res = (Prepend[rep, #]& /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep〚1, i + 1〛, rep〚1, i〛], {i, 1, Length[rep〚1〛] - 1}]]))},\n        If[Length[res〚1, 1〛] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat〚k, i〛, {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat〚k - 1, i〛, {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k + 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k - 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rep] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]\n    ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Λ, ν];\nΛ[1] = {2, 1, 0};\n\nν[n_][u_] := Product[(u - θ[l] - h Λ[l]〚n〛), {l, 1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Ee, ℒ, T, TG];\nEe[α_][i_, j_] := Ee[α][i, j] = JJ[i, j, Λ[α]];\nℒ[α_][i_, j_][u_] := ℒ[α][i, j][u] = u IdentityMatrix[dim[Λ[α]]] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h Ee[α][j, i];\nG = DiagonalMatrix[{z[1], z[2], z[3]}];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[i, j][u] = ℒ[1][i, j][u - θ[1]];\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := TG[i, j][u] = Sum[ℒ[1][i, k][u - θ[1]] G〚k, j〛, {k, 3}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*transfer matrices*)\nClearAll[QM, tG, QMG];\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] :=\n    QM[Ii, Jj][u] =\n    Sum[\n        Signature[Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛] (\n            Dot @@ (T[#][u + h - h Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}], #] // Flatten // Last]& /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}])\n        ),\n        {σ, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}\n    ];\n\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] :=\n    QMG[Ii, Jj][u] =\n    Sum[\n        Signature[Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛] (\n            Dot @@ (TG[#][u + h - h Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}], #] // Flatten // Last]& /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}])\n        ),\n        {σ, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}\n    ];\n\n\ntG[a_][u_] := tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[t];\nt[{0, 0}][u_] := t[{0, 0}][u] = IdentityMatrix[8] // Simplify\nt[{1, 0}][u_] := t[{1, 0}][u] = tG[1][u] // Simplify\nt[{1, 1}][u_] := t[{1, 1}][u] = tG[2][u] // Simplify;\nt[{2, 0}][u_] := t[{2, 0}][u] = tG[1][u].tG[1][u + h] - tG[2][u + h] // Simplify;\nt[{2, 1}][u_] := t[{2, 1}][u] = tG[2][u].tG[1][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] // Simplify;\nt[{2, 2}][u_] := t[{2, 2}][u] = tG[2][u].tG[2][u + h] - tG[3][u + h].tG[1][u] // Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rotparams =\n    {\n        p3 → (p2 (-z[1] + z[3])) / (p1 (z[2] - z[3])),\n        r1 → (p1 (z[2] - z[3])) / (p2 (z[1] - z[2])),\n        r2 → (z[2] - z[3]) / (p2 z[1] - p2 z[2]),\n        r3 → (z[1] - z[3]) / (p1 (-z[2] + z[3]))\n    };",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "vacL = {UnitVector[dim[Λ[1]], 1]}.MatrixExp[p1 Ee[1][1, 2]].MatrixExp[p2 Ee[1][1, 3]].MatrixExp[p3 Ee[1][2, 3]] /. rotparams;\nvacR = MatrixExp[r1 Ee[1][3, 2]].MatrixExp[r2 Ee[1][3, 1]].MatrixExp[r3 Ee[1][2, 1]].Transpose[{UnitVector[dim[Λ[1]], 1]}] /. rotparams;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## L = 1 orthogonality in the diagonal-twist frame: $\\det N$ of Q's and the norms $\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_A\\rangle$\n\nFor any gl(3) site rep `Λ[1]` (checked for $[2,1,0]$, $[3,1,0]$, $[3,2,0]$, $[2,0,0]$, $[4,2,0]$).\n\n- **Gauge.** $t^G_a(u)$ is polynomial in $u$, with $t^G_3=z_1z_2z_3\\,\\nu_1(u-2h)\\nu_2(u-h)\\nu_3(u)$.\n- **Q's.** $Q_i(u)=z_i^{u/h}q_i(u)$ with $\\deg q_i=\\lambda_1-\\mu_i$, and $Q^j(u)=z_j^{-u/h}q^j(u)$ with $\\deg q^j=\\mu_j$. Both are monic.\n- **$\\det N^{AB}$.** Rows $(i,j)\\in\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$ and columns $\\sum_n w_n\\{-Q^j_AQ_{i,B},\\;Q^j_AQ^{[-2]}_{i,B},\\;Q^{j[2]}_AQ_{i,B}\\}$ at $x_n=\\theta+nh$, $n=\\lambda_3,\\dots,\\lambda_1$, with $w_n=1/\\prod_{m\\ne n}(n-m)$. Orthogonality: $\\det N^{AB}\\propto\\delta_{AB}$.\n- **States.** $|\\Psi_A\\rangle$ are right eigenvectors of $t^G_1,t^G_2$ and $\\langle\\Psi_A|$ are right eigenvectors of $(t^G_a)^T$. They are normalized by $\\langle \\text{vacL}|\\Psi_A\\rangle=1$ and $\\langle\\Psi_A|\\text{vacR}\\rangle=1$.\n- **Norm relation.**\n$$\n\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_B\\rangle=\\kappa\\,\\delta_{AB}\\,\\frac{\\det N^{AA}}{c^{\\rm ref}_A\\,\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_A},\\qquad\n\\Psi^{\\rm ref}=Q_1(\\theta+\\lambda_2h)\\big[Q_1(\\theta)Q_2(\\theta-h)-Q_2(\\theta)Q_1(\\theta-h)\\big],\n$$\n$$\nc^{\\rm ref}=Q^3(\\theta+\\lambda_2h)\\big[Q^3(\\theta+\\lambda_1h)Q^2(\\theta+(\\lambda_1+1)h)-Q^2(\\theta+\\lambda_1h)Q^3(\\theta+(\\lambda_1+1)h)\\big],\n$$\n$$\n\\kappa=\\frac{(\\lambda_1!)^3}{(z_2-z_1)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}\\,(z_1-z_3)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_3}\\,(z_2-z_3)^{\\lambda_2-\\lambda_3}}\\qquad(\\text{independent of }\\theta, h).\n$$\n  $\\kappa$ is fixed by $\\langle\\Omega|\\Omega\\rangle=1$ for $|\\Omega\\rangle=e_1$, the highest-weight state. Its closed form comes from solving $\\Omega$'s Baxter equations exactly with symbolic $z,\\theta,h$ (cell 6). It was fitted on $[2,1,0]$, $[3,1,0]$, $[3,2,0]$ and then predicted exactly for $[2,0,0]$ and $[4,2,0]$. All reps tested have $\\lambda_3=0$, so the $\\lambda_3$ dependence (e.g. $\\lambda_1!$ vs $(\\lambda_1-\\lambda_3)!$) is not yet fixed. The norm relation holds for every state of the five reps to about $10^{-87}$.\n\nThe numeric check uses one point: unimodular $z$ (needed by the Baxter operators), $\\theta=1/3$ and fixed $p_1,p_2$. General reps have weight sectors of multiplicity $>1$, so the eigenvectors are only available numerically. To test another rep, change `Λ[1]` in cell 2 and re-run; cells 5 and 7 keep one entry per rep.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Numeric point, polynomial transfer matrices, right/left eigenstates. ---- *)\nClearAll[precO, ptO, hO, thO, zO, lamO, dsO, tPolyO, coefO, rhoO, KO, statesO, vacLO, vacRO];\nprecO = 100;\nptO = {h -> 1, θ[1] -> 1/3, z[1] -> 5/2, z[2] -> 7/3, z[3] -> 6/35, p1 -> 3/5, p2 -> 4/7};\nhO = h /. ptO; thO = θ[1] /. ptO; zO = N[{z[1], z[2], z[3]} /. ptO, precO];\nlamO = Λ[1]; dsO = dim[lamO];\n\n(* TG carries no 1/ν1 normalization, so tG[a] is already polynomial in u (the old notebook's T_a) *)\ntPolyO[a_] := tPolyO[a] = Expand[tG[a][u]] /. ptO;\ncoefO[a_, k_] := coefO[a, k] = N[Coefficient[tPolyO[a], u, k], precO];\n\n(* a generic combination of the coefficient matrices of t1, t2 has a nondegenerate spectrum, so one Eigensystem diagonalizes all of them *)\nrhoO[a_, k_] := Prime[7 a + k + 1]/(11 + 2 a + k);\nKO = Sum[rhoO[a, k] coefO[a, k], {a, 2}, {k, 0, a}];\nvacLO = N[Flatten[vacL /. ptO], precO];\nvacRO = N[Flatten[vacR /. ptO], precO];\n\nstatesO = Module[{valsR, vecsR, valsL, vecsL},\n    {valsR, vecsR} = Eigensystem[KO];\n    {valsL, vecsL} = Eigensystem[Transpose[KO]];\n    Table[\n        Module[{v = vecsR[[s]], w = vecsL[[First @ Ordering[Abs[valsL - valsR[[s]]], 1]]], p, tau},\n            v = v / (vacLO . v);\n            w = w / (w . vacRO);\n            p = First @ Ordering[-Abs[v], 1];\n            tau = Table[Sum[(coefO[a, k] . v)[[p]] / v[[p]] u^k, {k, 0, a}], {a, 3}];\n            <|\n                \"ket\" -> v, \"bra\" -> w, \"t\" -> tau,\n                \"mu\" -> Table[Diagonal[Ee[1][i, i]][[p]], {i, 3}],\n                \"eigRes\" -> Max[Flatten @ Table[{Abs[coefO[a, k] . v - Coefficient[tau[[a]], u, k] v], Abs[w . coefO[a, k] - Coefficient[tau[[a]], u, k] w]}, {a, 3}, {k, 0, a}]],\n                \"wtRes\" -> Max[Flatten @ Table[Abs[N[Ee[1][i, i]] . v - Diagonal[Ee[1][i, i]][[p]] v], {i, 3}]]\n            |>\n        ],\n        {s, Length[valsR]}\n    ]\n];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"rep Λ[1]\", Row[lamO, \",\"]},\n        {\"# states\", Length[statesO]},\n        {\"tG[1..3] polynomial in u\", And @@ (PolynomialQ[#, u] & /@ Flatten[Table[tPolyO[a], {a, 3}]])},\n        {\"min relative eigenvalue gap of the mixed matrix\", N[Min[Abs[Differences[Sort[Eigenvalues[KO]]]]] / Max[Abs[Eigenvalues[KO]]], 3]},\n        {\"max eigen residual (kets and bras, t1..t3)\", N[Max[statesO[[All, \"eigRes\"]]], 3]},\n        {\"max weight residual\", N[Max[statesO[[All, \"wtRes\"]]], 3]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"109\" data-out-n=\"1195\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"37\" data-sub-end=\"47\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1195]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep Λ[1]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tG[1..3] polynomial in u</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min relative eigenvalue gap of the mixed matrix</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max eigen residual (kets and bras, t1..t3)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max weight residual</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00123</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
