       "data": "Out[1205]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{max Baxter residual (direct deg $\\lambda$1-$\\mu$i, dual deg $\\mu$j)} & 0.\\times 10^{-93}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
