   "value": "(* ---- 6. Exact kappa = c^ref_Omega Psi^ref_Omega / det N^{Omega Omega} (since <Omega|Omega> = 1). Only Omega's Q's enter, and they are\n   low-degree polynomials, so the Baxter equations are solved exactly with symbolic z, θ, h. kappaS is NOT cleared, one entry per rep. ---- *)\nClearAll[tauS, BaxDirS, BaxDualS, solveExactS, qS, gS, QDS, QUS, rowS, detNS, psiRefS, cRefS, kappaExactS];\nIf[! AssociationQ[kappaS], kappaS = <||>];\n\ntauS = Table[Factor[(tG[a][u] . OmegaO)[[1]]], {a, 3}];\nBaxDirS[zz_][q_][x_] :=\n    zz ν[1][x] ν[1][x - h] ν[1][x - 2 h] q[x + h] - (tauS[[1]] /. u -> x) ν[1][x - h] ν[1][x - 2 h] q[x]\n    + (tauS[[2]] /. u -> x) ν[1][x - 2 h] q[x - h] / zz - (tauS[[3]] /. u -> x) q[x - 2 h] / zz^2;\nBaxDualS[y_][g_][x_] :=\n    ν[3][x + h] ν[3][x + 2 h] ν[3][x + 3 h] g[x] - y (tauS[[1]] /. u -> x + h) ν[3][x + 2 h] ν[3][x + 3 h] g[x + h]\n    + y^2 (tauS[[2]] /. u -> x + 2 h) ν[3][x + 3 h] g[x + 2 h] - y^3 (tauS[[3]] /. u -> x + 3 h) g[x + 3 h];\n(* monic solution, exact; the system is overdetermined, so Solve also certifies that one exists *)\nsolveExactS[op_, degree_] := Module[{c, x, q, sol},\n    q = Function[y, Evaluate[y^degree + Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, degree - 1}]]];\n    sol = If[degree == 0, {{}}, Solve[Thread[CoefficientList[Together[op[q][x]] // Numerator, x] == 0], Table[c[m], {m, 0, degree - 1}]]];\n    If[sol === {}, $Failed, Function[y, Evaluate[Factor[q[y] /. First[sol]]]]]\n];\n\nDo[qS[i] = solveExactS[BaxDirS[z[i]], lamO[[1]] - lamO[[i]]], {i, 3}];\nDo[gS[j] = solveExactS[BaxDualS[1 / z[j]], lamO[[j]]], {j, 3}];\nQDS[i_, x_] := z[i]^(x / h) qS[i][x];\nQUS[j_, x_] := z[j]^(-x / h) gS[j][x];\n\nrowS[{i_, j_}] := Sum[\n    With[{x = θ[1] + n h}, wO[n] {-QUS[j, x] QDS[i, x], QUS[j, x] QDS[i, x - h], QUS[j, x + h] QDS[i, x]}],\n    {n, polesO}\n];\ndetNS = Det[rowS /@ {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}];\npsiRefS = With[{x = θ[1] + xRefO h}, QDS[1, x[[1]]] (QDS[1, x[[2]]] QDS[2, x[[3]] - h] - QDS[2, x[[2]]] QDS[1, x[[3]] - h])];\ncRefS = With[{y = θ[1] + yRefO h}, QUS[3, y[[1]]] (QUS[3, y[[2]]] QUS[2, y[[3]] + h] - QUS[2, y[[2]]] QUS[3, y[[3]] + h])];\nkappaExactS = Factor[Simplify[PowerExpand[cRefS psiRefS / detNS], z[1] > 0 && z[2] > 0 && z[3] > 0 && h > 0]];\nkappaS[lamO] = kappaExactS;\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"rep\", Row[lamO, \",\"]},\n        {\"Omega is an eigenvector of tG[1..3]\", And @@ Table[Simplify[tG[a][u] . OmegaO - tauS[[a]] OmegaO] === ConstantArray[0, dsO], {a, 3}]},\n        {\"exact Baxter solutions exist\", FreeQ[{Table[qS[i], {i, 3}], Table[gS[j], {j, 3}]}, $Failed]},\n        {\"exact kappa vs numeric kappaO\", N[Abs[(kappaExactS /. ptO) / kappaO - 1], 3]},\n        {\"kappa\", kappaExactS}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"114\" data-out-n=\"1245\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"43\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1245]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.2703em;vertical-align:-2.8652em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.4052em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.3652em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.2303em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.8652em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.3652em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.5252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Omega is an eigenvector of tG[1..3]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exact Baxter solutions exist</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.9252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exact kappa vs numeric kappaO</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.7201em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kappa</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.8652em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.2303em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.8652em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.3652em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.5252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.9252em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">92</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.7201em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5898em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8575em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.8971em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5852em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.8652em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.2303em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.8652em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9303em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.1303em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.3303em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.5303em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.7303em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.8652em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
