  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. Closed form: kappa = (lambda1!)^3 / ((z2 - z1)^(lambda1-lambda2) (z1 - z3)^(lambda1-lambda3) (z2 - z3)^(lambda2-lambda3)), independent of θ and h.\n   Compared with every exact kappa stored in kappaS by cell 6. ---- *)\nClearAll[kappaClosed];\nkappaClosed[lam_] := lam[[1]]!^3 / ((z[2] - z[1])^(lam[[1]] - lam[[2]]) (z[1] - z[3])^(lam[[1]] - lam[[3]]) (z[2] - z[3])^(lam[[2]] - lam[[3]]));\nGrid[\n    Prepend[KeyValueMap[{Row[#1, \",\"], #2, Simplify[#2 - kappaClosed[#1]] === 0} &, kappaS], {\"rep\", \"exact kappa\", \"= closed form\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"115\" data-out-n=\"1248\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"14\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1248]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.3916em;vertical-align:-3.9258em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4658em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.4258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4258em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.3516em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9258em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4258em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.5858em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.3807em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9504em;\"><span class=\"pst